SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Ypsos
LOCATION:Ypsos\, Corfu\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The resort village of Ypsos keeps a real three-day panigiri around its church of Agia Paraskevi: vespers at 8pm on the 25th\, liturgy with artoklasia on the 26th and a supplication at 7:30pm\, and each night a big open-air dining area behind the church with the Faiakes orchestra playing Corfiot and Greek dance music. Free entry\, pay for food and drink\; it is on the main coast road so buses from town run late.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#ypsos-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-ypsos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#ypsos-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-ypsos
